.* QUIAUTL: DSPAUTL (one authorization list) and WRKAUTL (the lists).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=AUTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 9'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=ALNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ALOWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ALTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=ALUSER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ALAUT CLASS=AUTCL.
:VAR NAME=ALMGT CLASS=FLAGCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=USERS VARS='ALUSER ALAUT ALMGT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=LISTS VARS='OPT ALNAME ALTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='CMD ?CRTAUTL'.F6=Create
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPAUTL HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Authorization List
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAI VAR=ALNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Authorization list
:DATAI VAR=ALOWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner
:DATAI VAR=ALTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=USERS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=ALUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL VAR=ALAUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Object Authority
:LISTCOL VAR=ALMGT USAGE=OUTPUT.List Mgt
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKAUTL HELP=HLPWRK KEYL=WRKKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Authorization Lists
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LISTS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTAUTL AUTL(&ALNAME.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPAUTL AUTL(&ALNAME.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD DSPAUTLOBJ AUTL(&ALNAME.)'.6=Display objects
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=ALNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.List
:LISTCOL VAR=ALTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display Authorization List - Help
:P.This display shows an authorization list: who owns it, and the
authority each user on it has to the objects it secures. An X under
List Mgt lets that user add and remove users of the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWRK.Work with Authorization Lists - Help
:P.This display lists the authorization lists. Type 5 next to one to
see its users, 6 to see the objects it secures, or 4 to delete it, and
press Enter. F6 creates a new list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
